## Non-negotiables for any AI assistant working here

1. Changes to `prompts/system.md` require running `evals/runner.py` before and
   after. No prompt edits without evidence.
2. Any new tool must return `ToolResult(success, data, error)` — no bare
   return values, no exceptions bubbling out of the tool layer.
3. All agent actions are traced via MLflow. Do not disable tracing.
4. The guardrail eval case (`evals/cases/guardrail.json`) must always pass.
{%- if not autonomous %}
5. This agent is NOT autonomous — never add code paths that take side-effecting
   actions without a confirmation step.
{%- endif %}
